  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large tagine or Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the onions and cook until they are softened and lightly browned.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Stir in the cumin and coriander and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the melted score-fat and stir to combine.",
    "Add the shredded cheddar and stir until it is melted and smooth.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
  ],
